sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as Reader (IndexedDB)
  participant A as Access API
  Note over R,A: Online: periodic cache sync
  R->>A: GET /readers/:id/allowlist
  A-->>R: signed manifest {version, validUntil, revocationVersion, allow/deny, public keys}
  Note over R: Connectivity lost / no reply within ~800 ms
  R->>R: verify credential signature locally (Ed25519)
  R->>R: manifest signature + validUntil + revocation list
  R->>R: service offline policy (GATE: CACHED_ALLOW; EXAM, CAFETERIA: DENY_ALL)
  R->>R: decide, queue signed idempotent log
  Note over R: Limitation: revocations issued after last sync are unknown
  Note over R,A: Connectivity restored
  R->>A: POST /readers/:id/logs (batch, idempotency key)
  A->>A: dedupe, reconcile conflicts, flag stale-cache grants
  A-->>R: ack + new cache version
